  (null,0,253,'habit-daily-devotional','Daily Devotional + Journal','discipline','manual',false,true,'{"type": "🌿 Accountability · Levels 1 & 2", "title": "Daily Devotional Journal", "body": "<h3>Overview</h3>\n    <p>The daily devotional journal is the heartbeat of the MULTIPLY discipleship system. It is not merely a \"quiet time checklist\" — it is the primary place where a disciple encounters God in His Word and responds in writing.</p>\n    <h3>The Daily Practice</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Read:</strong> The day''s passage from the church devotional guide (15 min)</li>\n      <li><strong>Reflect:</strong> The devotional commentary from the guide (5 min)</li>\n      <li><strong>Respond:</strong> Journal entries answering the 3 daily prompts (10–15 min)\n        <ul>\n          <li>What is God saying to me in this passage?</li>\n          <li>What does it mean for my life today?</li>\n          <li>What specific action or attitude will I change?</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>Request:</strong> A prayer based on what was read (5 min)</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>Accountability</h3>\n    <p>The journal is the primary tool for the monthly discipler meeting. The discipler reviews the previous month''s entries together with the disciple — celebrating growth, addressing gaps, and identifying patterns where God is consistently speaking.</p>", "footer": "Your Church · Daily Devotional Journal · Printed guides available quarterly", "source": "multiply-template"}'::jsonb),
